=
 Possible design for event/action based addition to Remix'd'.
=

using get "actionLib" from "remixdPrograms/Interactions"
	
	'var' : an interaction variable
	
	'var' action ['value' = 4]
		"'var' is equal to four" ↲
	
	'var' action ['value' < 10]
		"'var' is less than 10" ↲
	
	set 'var' to 4
	'var' value ↲
	set 'var' to 8
	'var' value ↲
	
